in suit development\n\n**F1** appears to be the weakest tile - it's an honor tile with no clear pattern emerging, and I'm developing a suited-tile based hand.\n\nReason: F1 (East Wind) is isolated from my main hand structure which is developing around Bamboo tiles (B1, B2, B3) and has multiple pairs for flexibility. While F1 is my Seat Wind (worth 2 points if formed as pung), I only have 2 copies and it doesn't contribute to the strong Bamboo sequence pattern I'm building. Discarding F1 maintains maximum flexibility with my suited tiles while removing the least useful honor tile.\n\nAnswer: Play F1"}
